The factor correlations are expected to be positive but moderate, with illustrative values \(\phi_{AR}=0.4, \phi_{AS}=0.2, \phi_{RS}=0.3\). This structure will be tested via confirmatory factor analysis in future empirical work; its theoretical consequences are derived in Section 4.6.

