### B.2 Algorithm 5.2 Adaptive Factor Evaluation – Details

```
Initialize: successes = 0, trials = 0.
While trials < max_trials and precision not reached:
   trial += 1
   score = evaluate(SUT, next_task)
   successes += score
   p_hat = successes / trials
   half_width = z_{α/2} * sqrt(p_hat*(1-p_hat)/trials)
   if half_width <= δ_max/2: break
Return normalized p_hat and Δ_X = 2 * half_width.
```
The worst-case standard error bound \(0.5/\sqrt{n}\) ensures termination after at most \(n_{\max} = \lceil 1/(4\delta^2) \rceil\) trials.

